	(text "Units: D = B137, C = B136, B = B135, A = B134. Every pin carries a global net label used on the other sheets.\nPin functions: documents/oem-ecm-pinout-2004-sti.csv (FSM EN(STi)-18..22, wiring WI-106..118); check: tools/pinout_check.py.\nCoil outputs B15-B18 run through F1-F4 (50 mA PTC). R1/R2 divide battery voltage for IN_VMAIN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
